<lb n="18"/>möchten wir wol, so es <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">üch</unclear> nit <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zu</unclear> wider, ein <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wüßen</unclear>-
<lb n="19"/>schafft haben <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">der</unclear> ordnung so <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Ihr</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">deß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">müntzens</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">halber</unclear>
